#: docs/silkie/pointer-image-protocol.rst:2
msgid "Image pointer extension"
msgstr "图像指针扩展"

#: docs/silkie/pointer-image-protocol.rst:4
msgid ""
"Silkie adds image-backed pointers to `kitty's pointer shape protocol "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/pointer-shapes/>`_. That specification defines the OSC 22 "
"framing, shape stack, and queries."
msgstr ""
"Silkie 为 `kitty 指针形状协议 <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/pointer-shapes/>`_ 添加了基于图像的指针。该规范定义 OSC "
"22 封装、形状栈和查询。"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:4
msgid "Image shapes"
msgstr "图像形状"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:8
msgid ""
"A program can use an image it has sent with the :doc:`graphics-protocol` as the pointer, for "
"example a drawing program showing the size and color of the current brush under the pen. Anywhere"
" a shape name is accepted, the name::"
msgstr "程序可将通过 :doc:`graphics-protocol` 发送的图像用作指针，例如绘图程序在笔下显示当前画笔的大小和颜色。在任何接受形状名称的位置，以下名称：::"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:14
msgid ""
"refers to the image transmitted with that ``i=`` id in the same window. The hotspot is the pixel "
"of the image that sits under the pointer position, with the origin at the top left corner; one or"
" both coordinates may be left out and default to zero. For example, a 2 pixel wide outline of a "
"circle with a 48 pixel diameter, sent as image ``9``, centered on the pointer::"
msgstr ""
"引用同一窗口中以该 ``i=`` ID 传输的图像。热点是图像中位于指针位置的像素，以左上角为原点；可以省略一个或两个坐标，默认值为零。例如，将宽 2 像素、直径 48 像素的圆形轮廓作为图像 "
"``9`` 发送，并让其中心与指针对齐：::"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:22
msgid ""
"The image is shown with one image pixel per physical pixel, exactly as the graphics protocol "
"displays an image placed without scaling, so a brush preview drawn at the size the brush has on "
"the canvas lines up with it. The window and cell sizes reported by ``CSI 14 t`` and ``CSI 16 t`` "
"are in the same pixels. The current frame of an animated image is used, changes to the frames of "
"the image are reflected on the pointer."
msgstr ""
"图像的每个像素对应一个物理像素，与图形协议显示未缩放放置图像的方式相同，因此按画布中实际画笔大小绘制的预览可与画笔对齐。``CSI 14 t`` 和 ``CSI 16 t`` "
"报告的窗口和字符单元尺寸也使用相同的像素单位。动画图像使用当前帧；图像帧的变化会反映到指针上。"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:29
msgid ""
"The name is only a reference to the image. If no image with that id exists when the shape is set,"
" or the image is deleted later, the entry is ignored and the pointer falls back to the shape "
"below it on the stack, or to the default shape, until an image with that id is transmitted again."
" Deleting the image therefore does not pop the stack. The reply to ``?__current__`` is the image "
"name, with both hotspot coordinates, when an image shape is in effect. The query form "
"``?image:1:2:3`` answers ``1`` when the terminal supports image shapes, regardless of whether "
"image ``1`` exists."
msgstr ""
"名称只是对图像的引用。设置形状时若对应 ID 的图像不存在，或图像随后被删除，则忽略该条目，指针回退到栈中下一层形状或默认形状，直到再次传输该 ID "
"的图像。因此删除图像不会弹出栈条目。图像形状生效时，``?__current__`` 的回复是带有两个热点坐标的图像名称。只要终端支持图像形状，查询形式 ``?image:1:2:3`` 就返回"
" ``1``，无论图像 ``1`` 是否存在。"

#: docs/pointer-shapes.rst:38
msgid ""
"An image larger than the platform allows for a pointer, which happens on X11 for big images, is "
"ignored as if it did not exist. A multiplexer or a relay such as mosh passes the name through "
"unchanged, the terminal at the far end resolves the id among the images of that window."
msgstr "图像超过平台允许的指针尺寸时（例如 X11 上的大图像），按不存在处理。多路复用器或 mosh 等中继原样透传名称，由远端终端在该窗口的图像中解析 ID。"

